      "id": "claim_730d7591a6164210b99ba4b903b8e6d1",
      "statement": "step tokens default to issuer 'step-cli', audience 'https://ca/sign', 5-minute validity bounded by MinValidity 10s and MaxValidity 1h, with a 30-minute MaxValidityDelay for not-before skew; custom claims include sha, sans, step, user, and cnf.",
