      "statement": "token/options.go provides option setters for root-CA SHA, SANs, user data, SSH options, confirmation fingerprints, validity windows, and header-embedded credentials including WithX5CCerts, WithX5CInsecureCerts, WithNebulaCert, and WithSSHPOPFile.",
