      "statement": "token/parse.go models the claim vocabularies of JWK, OIDC, GCP, AWS, Azure, K8sSA, and Nebula tokens, classifies payloads via Payload.Type(), and offers signature-verifying Parse plus unverified ParseInsecure.",
