      "statement": "provisionerPrompt filters the authority's provisioner list by the flags present (x5c-*, sshpop-*, nebula-*, k8ssa-token-path), narrows by --kid and provisioner/issuer name, auto-selects a single candidate, and interactively prompts otherwise.",
